    queue: "Shows the current track, loop mode and 8 upcoming tracks per page, with arrow buttons. Move reorders two positions, dedupe removes repeated sources, and jump moves a chosen upcoming track next and skips the current track. Queue editing requires DJ access when DJ mode is active; browsing stays available to listeners. " + music,
