    loop: "Chooses off, track or queue looping for this session. Track repeats the current item; queue cycles tracks; off lets playback advance normally. Does not save a permanent playlist. " + music,
    seek: "Moves to an integer second position within the current track, from 0–7,200 and strictly before the track's end. Use seconds, not mm:ss notation. Requires a seekable resolved track and restarts its audio stream at the selected point. " + music,
